	(descr "Epson TG2016SMN TCXO, 2.0 x 1.6 x 0.73 mm, 4 pads. Land pattern per datasheet TG2016/2520SMN_EN ver. 1.3, section 8 (recommended foot print): pads 0.6 x 0.75 mm, pitch 1.65 mm (long side) x 1.13 mm (short side). Drawn with the long side vertical like the KiCad TG2520SMN footprint: pin 1 top left, 2 bottom left, 3 bottom right, 4 top right. 1 = N.C., 2 = GND, 3 = OUT, 4 = VCC. Keepout between the pads: the datasheet asks for no pattern between the footprint pads.")
